[Music]  Vanessa bryan pease tribute to her  daughter Gianna on what would have been  her 14th birthday on Friday the 37 year  old posted this gorgeous pic of her  sweet baby girl smiling and wished her a  happy birthday in the caption quote  mommy loves you more than I can ever  show you you are part of my soul forever  I miss you so much every day Vanessa  went on to write quote I wish I could  wake up and have you here with me I miss  your smile your hugs and your giggles I  miss everything about you Gigi I love  you so much  soon after the mom before posted a  series of photos with a caption  encouraging people to wear red in honor  of her late daughter's birthday vanessa  explains that gigi loved to wear a red  bow in all of her school pictures the  color of love in life she writes in part  quote please consider wearing red  caption an act of kindness or show how  you will play Gigi's way since she  always gave everything she did her all  and led with kindness Gigi and Vanessa's  husband basketball great Kobe Bryant  lost their lives along with seven others  in a January helicopter crash  [Applause]  they were in route to a basketball  tournament at Kobe's Mamba Academy thank  you so much for honoring my GG been  selecting her to be an honorary draft  pick this year it would have been a  dream come true for her last month the  WNBA made Gigi an honorary draft pick  the youngest ever she worked tirelessly  every single day she wanted to be one of  the greatest athletes of all time just  like her daddy so thank you thank you  for honoring my little girl  despite the unimaginable pain of losing  her husband and Gigi vanessa has managed  to stay strong for her three daughters  17 year old Natalia three year old  Bianca and nine month old Capri the wife  of the late NBA star shared beautiful  photos of her and her daughter  celebrating their first Easter without  Kobe and Gigi she even posted this  adorable video of Bianca and Capri  enjoying some Easter treats back in  February a source close to the family  told ET that Vanessa knows the grieving  process will be long and hard the source  went on to say that she is overwhelmed  with the outpouring of love her and her  family received  you

